,\"chunks\":[\"831:static/chunks/8e0837e3-cfb6d5ab8c40a8f9.js\",\"658:static/chunks/658-0c990256c900ec59.js\",\"650:static/chunks/650-c5bd9f6b0eba8b1a.js\",\"755:static/chunks/app/events/[slug]/page-26b35f4e5b258cf7.js\"],\"name\":\"ImageCarousel\",\"async\":false}\n12:I{\"id\":325,\"chunks\":[\"831:static/chunks/8e0837e3-cfb6d5ab8c40a8f9.js\",\"658:static/chunks/658-0c990256c900ec59.js\",\"650:static/chunks/650-c5bd9f6b0eba8b1a.js\",\"755:static/chunks/app/events/[slug]/page-26b35f4e5b258cf7.js\"],\"name\":\"SocialMediaCont"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"ainer\",\"async\":false}\n13:T44e,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"? Looking for inspiration for an engaging STEM or STEAM night that connects families and the community? Take a look at how Bracken STEAM Academy in Clark County hosted a fantastic Family STEAM Night using Project-Based Learning (PBL)! ?\n\nFamilies interacted with QR codes that linked to videos where students identified real-world problems within their school. Then, families worked side-by-side with students to brainstorm and create solutions. ??‍?‍?‍?\n\nFor example, one student project tackled the challenge of designing a roller coaster for a new theme park opening nearby—a perfect way to transform “boredom” into hands-on learning and engineering fun! ? Another project explored why a particular plant thrived in a unique spot where no other plants could grow, sparking curiosity and discovery in both students and their families. ??\n\nBravo to Bracken STEAM Academy @brackenmagnet for bringing learning to life and building a stronger community through STEAM! ??‍? \n\nVisit the link in our bio to watch the video. \n#PBL #FamilySTEAM #NevadaEducation #NVPortraitofaLearner #CCSDMagnet"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"d:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"style_main-content-container-homepage__mq6Ub\",\"data-page\":\"homepage\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"style_nvd-section__oFbqm\",\"children\":[